# UX workflow: validate canonical sequencer scope cycling.
# Purpose: captures the global grammar root cycle `Track -> Pattern -> Step -> Track`,
# confirms Track does not expose musical property overlays, then validates the
# child-context cycle `Pattern -> Step -> Pattern`.
# Expect: capture_match:root_track_initial=root_track_after_cycle, capture_match:track_before_left_bottom=track_left_bottom_down, capture_match:child_pattern_focus=child_pattern_after_cycle

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen root_track_initial

# Root scope cycle: Track -> Pattern -> Step -> Track.
150 tap NAV 60
350 capture screen root_pattern_focus
450 tap NAV 60
650 capture screen root_step_focus
750 tap NAV 60
950 capture screen root_track_after_cycle

# Track keeps the left property selectors inactive.
1050 capture screen track_before_left_bottom
1100 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
1320 capture screen track_left_bottom_down
1370 button LEFT_BOTTOM up

# Move back into Pattern/Step, create a micro-sequence child context on step 1.
1500 tap NAV 60
1700 tap NAV 60
1850 tap MACRO_1 60
2050 button MACRO_1 down
3110 tick
3170 capture screen root_step_edit_for_micro
3230 button MACRO_1 up

# Focus Micro-sequence row and enter the child pattern context.
3330 encoder NAV 1
3410 encoder NAV 1
3490 encoder NAV 1
3570 encoder NAV 1
3650 encoder NAV 1
3730 encoder NAV 1
3810 encoder NAV 1
3890 capture screen parent_micro_row_focused
3990 tap NAV 60
4290 capture screen child_pattern_focus

# Child scope cycle: Pattern -> Step -> Pattern.
4390 tap NAV 60
4590 capture screen child_step_focus
4690 tap NAV 60
4890 capture screen child_pattern_after_cycle
